Package: TALLBMDeconv
Type: Package
Title: Atlas-Guided Deconvolution of Paediatric T-ALL Bone Marrow
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Jiayue", "Gu", email = "jiayue.gu@ed.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Versioned single-cell reference management, fixed-reference
    BayesPrism initial read allocation, optional typed flow observations,
    file-backed expression and gene-source outputs, and patient-level paired
    validation. Keeps RNA contribution, cell proxies and expression recovery
    distinct. The default execution kernel reproduces the project's frozen
    BayesPrism initial-allocation configuration without reference updating.
